          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Nausea began approximately 5 days ago; vomiting began approximately 4 days ago, peaked over 2 days, and was 5–6 times daily at worst, initially food then bile. Last vomited yesterday morning; now largely settled."
      }
    },
